<title>USA: Mercury Finance opens trading at 1-5/8.</title>
<headline>Mercury Finance opens trading at 1-5/8.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Mercury Finance Corp opened trading at 1-5/8, off 13-1/4 on the New York Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>The stock has not traded on the NYSE since Tuesday. The company said on Wednesday it had restated its earnings for the past four years due to accounting irregularities, lowering earnings by about $90 million.</p>
<p>The stock rebounded slightly after its opening, trading off 12-5/8 or about 85 percent to 2-1/4.</p>
